<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    Hris.Foundation.Extension
    Sprint 4 (Kernel-Dependent Frameworks, Round 1) scope, per IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
    Phase 1: second of Sprint 4's own eight frameworks, no forced order among them.
    Source specification: docs/03-foundation/extension-framework.md. Built entirely
    from scratch this Sprint, matching Tenant Framework's own precedent: no Domain
    layer existed for this one before this pass.

    Deliberately narrower than the source document's own full Scope: Plugin
    Management, and the Developed/Validated/Packaged/Installed/Activated/Updated/
    Deprecated/Removed Extension Lifecycle, are not built here: see
    Domain/ExtensionPoint.cs's own remarks for why (split across administration's own
    TenantExtension aggregate, Phase 3, and Phase 8's Marketplace publishing pipeline,
    neither of which exists in code yet). This Sprint builds the one piece with no
    forward dependency on either: the published extension-point contract registry and
    its Hook subscriptions.
  -->

